{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1cfe3501-cf49-8869-84eb-52f1a8d833ec",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T12:09:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilson Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:03:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:03:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Nilson Brito. I just bought a house and I got a water and sewer bill in the mail. It's in the name of the guy who owned it before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:03:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that happens a lot with a new sale. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "23 Pelham Street. Up the Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:03:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 23 Pelham. Let me pull that up. And when did you close on the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:03:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Closed about three weeks ago. Moved in the week after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:04:02-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So what's likely going on is the account is still under the seller's name until the deed gets recorded and we get the change over. The bill goes out under whoever is on the account at the time of the reading. It doesn't mean you're not responsible for your part of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:04:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I owe it. That's the way it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:04:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, part of it. Let me look at the dates. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:04:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. [pause] Sorry, hold on, I got the mixer going. Let me shut this off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:04:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Baking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:04:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Batter. Okay, it's off. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:04:54-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the bill covers a period that started before you closed. The meter reading was taken about a week after your closing date. Usually the seller's attorney or the closing handles the portion up to the sale date, and we bill the final reading to the account. Do you have a copy of your closing paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:05:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somewhere. Got a big folder. I didn't see a water line in it, but I wasn't reading every page."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Worth checking for a final water adjustment. If there wasn't one, you can send us a copy of the first page of the settlement statement and the deed info, and we'll put the account in your name going forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Send it how? Email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can bring it by City Hall, or mail it to the utilities billing office. Or I can have the office send you a form to fill out if you give me a mailing address. You're already at Pelham, so it would go there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:06:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail it to the house. That works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'll note that on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:06:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Now, the amount on this thing is more than I figured. Can I do a payment plan? Break it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can look at that. Usually it's an arrangement where you pay a portion now and the rest over a few months. The thing is, I'd want to get the account straightened out first so we're setting it up under the right name. But go ahead and call back once you've sent the paperwork, or I can put a note that you're asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:07:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Put the note. I'd rather not have it go late while I'm sorting it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:07:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that you contacted us today about the transfer and the plan, so there's a record of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:07:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Another thing. I work days, and I'm usually not off till after you close. Is there a phone line I can pay on at night? Like an automated one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's an automated phone payment option that runs around the clock, and you can pay online too, any hour. You'd need the account number from the bill. Since the bill is in the previous owner's name, you can still use that account number to pay what's due. There's also a drop box outside City Hall for checks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:08:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Phone one's good. I'm not big on the computer. Where's the account number on the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Top right, there's a box that says account number. Usually a string of digits with a dash in it. The phone system will walk you through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:08:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Top right. I see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:08:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do you want to confirm your phone number for the note? I have it as 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:08:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:08:37-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So to recap, I'll send the form to 23 Pelham, you'll get your closing statement copy back to us, and then call about the payment plan. Meanwhile you can use the phone line at night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:08:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll look for that folder tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:08:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks. I got to get back to this batter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:09:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Enjoy it. Have a good afternoon, Mr. Brito."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
